{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00478",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.82,
      "end_seconds": 6.75,
      "duration_seconds": 5.93,
      "text": "Uh, doctor, hello, I've got my papers here, where should I put them?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.18,
      "end_seconds": 12.68,
      "duration_seconds": 4.5,
      "text": "Alright, no trouble at all, come in. What's been bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 15.36,
      "end_seconds": 18.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "Well, I've been having a high fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.24,
      "end_seconds": 21.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.21,
      "text": "When did you first notice it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 22.86,
      "end_seconds": 26.84,
      "duration_seconds": 3.98,
      "text": "Oh, it's been about two weeks, I'm fairly sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 31.07,
      "end_seconds": 40.18,
      "duration_seconds": 9.11,
      "text": "Can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps. I'm asking so that we don't miss anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 41.52,
      "end_seconds": 52.24,
      "duration_seconds": 10.72,
      "text": "Honestly, on and off. I'd say moderate. I just want to get back to normal, really. I thought it would sort itself out, but it hasn't."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 52.54,
      "end_seconds": 55.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "Okay, any severe body pain as well?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 56.53,
      "end_seconds": 59.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "Yeah, uh, yes, for three days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 60.84,
      "end_seconds": 64.47,
      "duration_seconds": 3.63,
      "text": "Have you had any abdominal pain or bleeding from the gums?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 65.3,
      "end_seconds": 70.23,
      "duration_seconds": 4.93,
      "text": "So, I haven't had abdominal pain or bleeding from the gums, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 73.06,
      "end_seconds": 74.91,
      "duration_seconds": 1.85,
      "text": "Any cough or vomiting at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 75.65,
      "end_seconds": 80.07,
      "duration_seconds": 4.42,
      "text": "So, you know, I haven't had cough or vomiting, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 82.7,
      "end_seconds": 85.82,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "What about your tummy and bowels, anything unusual there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 86.14,
      "end_seconds": 87.64,
      "duration_seconds": 1.5,
      "text": "Nothing unusual, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 88.68,
      "end_seconds": 90.85,
      "duration_seconds": 2.17,
      "text": "Any allergies I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 91.94,
      "end_seconds": 95.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.7,
      "text": "Well, um, yes, I'm allergic to codeine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 95.95,
      "end_seconds": 98.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.22,
      "text": "What medicines do you take regularly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 98.55,
      "end_seconds": 126.53,
      "duration_seconds": 27.98,
      "text": "I'm on amlodipine, 5 milligrams, once a day. Glimepiride. I take it 2 milligrams, before breakfast. I'd rather not end up on lots of tablets if I can avoid it. Sorry, I know I'm rambling a bit. It's aspirin, 75 milligrams, once a day. I'm, I'm on Dolo, 650 milligrams, when I get the fever. I didn't want to make a fuss, you know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 127.36,
      "end_seconds": 131.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.72,
      "text": "Do you have any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 131.97,
      "end_seconds": 144.76,
      "duration_seconds": 12.79,
      "text": "I've had high blood pressure, yes. It's a relief to finally sit down and talk about it. I looked a few things up online, and that probably didn't help."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 145.68,
      "end_seconds": 146.45,
      "duration_seconds": 0.77,
      "text": "Go on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 147.57,
      "end_seconds": 150.96,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "I've had diabetes, yes. Yes, heart disease."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 151.63,
      "end_seconds": 152.62,
      "duration_seconds": 0.99,
      "text": "Okay. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 153.88,
      "end_seconds": 156.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "Do you have any questions before we carry on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 157.59,
      "end_seconds": 170.0,
      "duration_seconds": 12.41,
      "text": "Right, uh, not at the moment, I think you've covered most of what I was wondering. If something comes to mind later, I'll ask you before I leave."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 170.41,
      "end_seconds": 172.21,
      "duration_seconds": 1.8,
      "text": "Any operations in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 173.57,
      "end_seconds": 179.53,
      "duration_seconds": 5.96,
      "text": "I mean, just a stent put in my heart, two years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 180.98,
      "end_seconds": 184.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.19,
      "text": "Sorry, the computer needs a moment to load this."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 184.67,
      "end_seconds": 185.5,
      "duration_seconds": 0.83,
      "text": "No rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 201.43,
      "end_seconds": 206.68,
      "duration_seconds": 5.25,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. Right, anyone in the family with similar problems or other conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 207.31,
      "end_seconds": 209.03,
      "duration_seconds": 1.72,
      "text": "My sister has epilepsy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 209.71,
      "end_seconds": 212.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "Let's get your blood pressure and the other basics."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 225.24,
      "end_seconds": 226.76,
      "duration_seconds": 1.52,
      "text": "Hold still for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 246.2,
      "end_seconds": 254.92,
      "duration_seconds": 8.72,
      "text": "Okay: temperature 38.5, heart rate 90, weight 78 kilos, blood pressure 125 over 79, height 164 centimetres, BMI works out to 29.0."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 255.91,
      "end_seconds": 257.28,
      "duration_seconds": 1.37,
      "text": "Is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 258.71,
      "end_seconds": 261.76,
      "duration_seconds": 3.05,
      "text": "We'll put it in context in a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 264.07,
      "end_seconds": 268.08,
      "duration_seconds": 4.01,
      "text": "Alright, I'd like to examine you now. Please come over here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 269.83,
      "end_seconds": 271.42,
      "duration_seconds": 1.59,
      "text": "Let me check your reflexes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 283.79,
      "end_seconds": 287.79,
      "duration_seconds": 4.0,
      "text": "There's a faint rash on your forearms, it blanches when I press."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 289.54,
      "end_seconds": 290.83,
      "duration_seconds": 1.29,
      "text": "Open wide for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 298.3,
      "end_seconds": 302.87,
      "duration_seconds": 4.57,
      "text": "Your tummy is soft, a little tender under the ribs on the right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 305.88,
      "end_seconds": 332.26,
      "duration_seconds": 26.38,
      "text": "That's fine, you can get dressed. Thank you for that. I'll write up what I found in a moment, and then I'll tell you what I think is going on. From what you've told me and what I found, it fits best with a viral fever, possibly dengue. The reason I say that is that your story and my examination fit together. Malaria is also on my list."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 332.83,
      "end_seconds": 341.68,
      "duration_seconds": 8.85,
      "text": "Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had a high fever for about two weeks, moderate, and no vomiting or abdominal pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 343.17,
      "end_seconds": 344.73,
      "duration_seconds": 1.56,
      "text": "Yes, that's right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 346.11,
      "end_seconds": 363.28,
      "duration_seconds": 17.17,
      "text": "We should do a dengue test for fever. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more. Drink a lot, coconut water, ORS, whatever you can manage. Make sure you're drinking plenty of fluids, two to three litres a day if you can, and get proper rest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 363.77,
      "end_seconds": 384.91,
      "duration_seconds": 21.14,
      "text": "Go on. Try to get to bed and wake up at the same time each day, and keep your phone away from the bed. Keep an eye out, and if you notice any bleeding or you can't keep fluids down, call us the same day or go to emergency. I'd like to see you again in two days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 387.45,
      "end_seconds": 388.15,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 389.18,
      "end_seconds": 393.02,
      "duration_seconds": 3.84,
      "text": "So, that's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 393.48,
      "end_seconds": 396.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.68,
      "text": "Nothing more from me, doctor, thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 396.77,
      "end_seconds": 397.94,
      "duration_seconds": 1.17,
      "text": "See you then."
    }
  ]
}